  "result": [
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "0",
        "end": "0",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "Hank Willis Thomas: I'm Deb's son.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E0463A1740",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "1",
        "end": "1",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "(Laughter) Deborah Willis: And I'm Hank's mom.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "30819EC5D6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "2",
        "end": "2",
        "startOffset": 5,
        "endOffset": 34,
        "text": "We've said that so many times",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "86E88A66CC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "3",
        "end": "3",
        "startOffset": 66,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "symbiotic relationship",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "94E996C211",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "4",
        "end": "4",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "And really, it's because everywhere we go, together or apart, we carry these monikers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "605ED7265F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "5",
        "end": "5",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 110,
        "text": "I've been following in my mother's footsteps since before I was even born and haven't figured out how to stop.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E764CD828D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "6",
        "end": "6",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 39,
        "text": "And as I get older, it does get harder.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D38F508A3F",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "7",
        "end": "7",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 29,
        "text": "No seriously, it gets harder.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EE87720194",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "8",
        "end": "8",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 86,
        "text": "(Laughter) My mother's taught me many things, though, most of all that love overrules.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CC5940F806",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "9",
        "end": "9",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 54,
        "text": "She's taught me that love is an action, not a feeling.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A09123CC33",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "10",
        "end": "10",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "it's a way of being, it's a way of doing, it's a way of listening and it's a way of seeing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F952A4486A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "11",
        "end": "11",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "DW: And also, the idea about love, photographers, they're looking for love when they make photographs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "882E4642C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "12",
        "end": "12",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "They're looking and looking",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "CFDCC6C726",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "13",
        "end": "13",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 254,
        "text": "Growing up in North Philadelphia, I was surrounded by people in my family and friends who made photographs and used the family camera as a way of telling a story about life, about life of joy, about what it meant to become a family in North Philadelphia.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A32C8AAB27",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "14",
        "end": "14",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 122,
        "text": "So I spent most of my life searching for pictures that reflect on ideas about black love, black joy and about family life.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F537258936",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 54,
        "endOffset": 68,
        "text": "love overrules",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7546A3F342",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "15",
        "end": "15",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "So it's really important to think about the action of love overrules as a verb.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8413B0F516",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 31,
        "endOffset": 46,
        "text": "love of looking",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FE3430D099",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "16",
        "end": "16",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 140,
        "text": "HWT: Sometimes I wonder if the love of looking is genetic, because, like my mother, I've loved photographs since before I can even remember.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "86BCCF7FB7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 65,
        "endOffset": 111,
        "text": "photography and photographs were my first love",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "74A0C07507",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "17",
        "end": "17",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "I think sometimes that -- after my mother and her mother -- that photography and photographs were my first love.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1B8F1BDB56",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 64,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "a \"ham\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E2D0BEB487",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "18",
        "end": "18",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 88,
        "text": "No offense to my father, but that's what you get for calling me a \"ham\" wherever you go.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0449359801",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "19",
        "end": "19",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 163,
        "text": "I remember whenever I'd go to my grandmother's house, she would hide all the photo albums because she was afraid of me asking, \"Well, who is that in that picture?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "0D03E08B84",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 5,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "Who are they to you and who are they to me",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F3414B60E0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "20",
        "end": "20",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 98,
        "text": "and \"Who are they to you and who are they to me, and how old were you when that picture was taken?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "23059985C5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "21",
        "end": "21",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 42,
        "text": "How old was I when that picture was taken?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5ABC5CC34C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "22",
        "end": "22",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 37,
        "text": "And why were they in black and white?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BA1D2D7EA5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "23",
        "end": "23",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 51,
        "text": "Was the world in black and white before I was born?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "643AFC0616",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "24",
        "end": "24",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 79,
        "text": "DW: Well, that's interesting, just to think about the world in black and white.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "598B051BB9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 107,
        "endOffset": 131,
        "text": "images that told stories",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "090E4EC1D4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "25",
        "end": "25",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 195,
        "text": "I grew up in a beauty shop in North Philadelphia, my mom's beauty shop, looking at \"Ebony Magazine,\" found images that told stories that were often not in the daily news, but in the family album.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5D87AC2504",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "26",
        "end": "26",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 218,
        "text": "I wanted the family album to be energetic for me, a way of telling stories, and one day I happened upon a book in the Philadelphia Public Library called \"The Sweet Flypaper of Life\" by Roy DeCarava and Langston Hughes.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9BD7669F54",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 58,
        "endOffset": 76,
        "text": "flypaper and sweet",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8BFBBCCB4C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "27",
        "end": "27",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 240,
        "text": "I think what attracted me as a seven-year-old, the title, flypaper and sweet, but to think about that as a seven-year-old, I looked at the beautiful images that Roy DeCarava made and then looked at ways that I could tell a story about life.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "94F1DE17B9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "28",
        "end": "28",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 61,
        "text": "And looking for me is the act that basically changed my life.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E7D8C2A50E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 126,
        "endOffset": 147,
        "text": "I think your question",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8DAEDDFFC7",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "29",
        "end": "29",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 289,
        "text": "HWT: My friend Chris Johnson told me that every photographer, every artist, is essentially trying to answer one question, and I think your question might have been, \"Why doesn't the rest of the world see how beautiful we are, and what can I do to help them see our community the way I do?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "90E64D9184",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 121,
        "endOffset": 124,
        "text": "you",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "209AEC657E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "45",
        "end": "45",
        "startOffset": 112,
        "endOffset": 120,
        "text": "and then",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4AF6162D5D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "46",
        "end": "46",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 27,
        "text": "(Applause) HWT: Thanks, ma.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D8DB896788",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "47",
        "end": "47",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "Like mother, like son.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "26A7E41CD3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "48",
        "end": "48",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "I grew up in a house full of photographs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "3397390938",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "49",
        "end": "49",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 75,
        "text": "They were everywhere, and my mother would turn the kitchen into a darkroom.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "FA0434508E",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "50",
        "end": "50",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 77,
        "text": "And there weren't just pictures that she took and pictures of family members.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5B1CA7B428",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "51",
        "end": "51",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 108,
        "text": "But there were pictures on the wall of and by people that we didn't know, men and women that we didn't know.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "28064BF443",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "52",
        "end": "52",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 11,
        "text": "Thanks, ma.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "21BB2F1421",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "53",
        "end": "53",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "(Laughter) I have my own timing.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E9EAFBCF20",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "54",
        "end": "54",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 22,
        "text": "Did you see",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A68D6F1AD4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "55",
        "end": "55",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 26,
        "text": "Puppet strings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B8A6DC822B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "56",
        "end": "56",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 41,
        "text": "I grew up in a house full of photographs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4BA2995AEC",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "57",
        "end": "57",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 221,
        "text": "(Applause) But they weren't just pictures of men and women that we knew, but pictures of people that I didn't know, Pretty much, it was pretty clear from what I learned in school, that the rest of the world didn't either.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4E3D6DFC0B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "58",
        "end": "58",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 97,
        "text": "And it took me a long time to figure out what she was up to, but after a while, I figured it out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "678FEE03C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "59",
        "end": "59",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 105,
        "text": "When I was nine years old, she published this book, \"Black Photographers, 1840-1940: A Bio-Bibliography.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1BB22AF954",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "60",
        "end": "60",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 94,
        "text": "And it's astounding to me to consider that in 1840, African Americans were making photographs.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C5A4C88620",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 102,
        "text": "What does it mean for us to think that at a time that was two, three decades before the end of slavery",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "796615ED2C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "61",
        "end": "61",
        "startOffset": 199,
        "endOffset": 237,
        "text": "cutting edge of science and technology",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F79C93A85C",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "62",
        "end": "62",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 47,
        "text": "And what compelled them to do that if not love?",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "F2E6DDB7DA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "63",
        "end": "63",
        "startOffset": 111,
        "endOffset": 397,
        "text": "and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book, and another book",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1EAE2ADD66",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "64",
        "end": "64",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 246,
        "text": "And throughout my life, she's edited and published dozens of books and curated numerous exhibitions on every continent, not all about black photographers but all inspired by the curiosity of a little black girl from North Philadelphia.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "17AA5990D2",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "65",
        "end": "65",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "DW: What I found is that black photographers had stories to tell, and we needed to listen.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8F34497F83",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "66",
        "end": "66",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 169,
        "text": "And then I found and I discovered black photographers like Augustus Washington, who made these beautiful daguerreotypes of the McGill family in the early 1840s and '50s.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "EF176AE91A",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 74,
        "endOffset": 93,
        "text": "different narrative",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "29E60E6D1D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "67",
        "end": "67",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 205,
        "text": "Their stories tended to be different, black photographers, and they had a different narrative about black life during slavery, but it was also about family life, beauty and telling stories about community.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2B1E2D6BFB",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "68",
        "end": "68",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 90,
        "text": "I didn't know how to link the stories, but I knew that teachers needed to know this story.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "C95F970C21",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "69",
        "end": "69",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "HWT: So I think I was my mother's first student.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "1818AC5344",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 31,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "puppet strings",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B10417F845",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "70",
        "end": "70",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 171,
        "text": "Unwillingly and unwittingly -- puppet strings -- I decided to pick up a camera, and thought that I should make my own pictures about the then and now and the now and then.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4F7EBBBC70",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "71",
        "end": "71",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 143,
        "text": "I thought about how I could use photography to talk about how what's going on outside of the frame of the camera can affect what we see inside.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "846BA6C190",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 4,
        "endOffset": 32,
        "text": "truth is always in the hands",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "70A583EE23",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "72",
        "end": "72",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 117,
        "text": "The truth is always in the hands of the actual image maker and it's up to us to really consider what's being cut out.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B45C698426",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "73",
        "end": "73",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 404,
        "text": "I thought I could use her research as a jumping-off point of things that I was seeing in society and I wanted to start to think about how I could use historical images to talk about the past being present and think about ways that we can speak to the perennial struggle for human rights and equal rights through my appropriation of photographs in the form of sculpture, video, installation and paintings.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BCC963DEBE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "74",
        "end": "74",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "But through it all, one piece has affected me the most.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4B1BEA554D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "75",
        "end": "75",
        "startOffset": 16,
        "endOffset": 23,
        "text": "nourish",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "FIG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "70F0F1E541",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "76",
        "end": "76",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 187,
        "text": "It's based off of this photograph by Ernest Withers, who took this picture in 1968 at the Memphis Sanitation Workers March of men and women standing collectively to affirm their humanity.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E9C2AA9668",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 35,
        "endOffset": 45,
        "text": "I am a man",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "30DF3FA948",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "77",
        "end": "77",
        "startOffset": 140,
        "endOffset": 152,
        "text": "I am the man",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "HUMOR"
        ]
      },
      "id": "31BBA41AFE",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "78",
        "end": "78",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 225,
        "text": "And I wanted to ponder that, so I decided to remix that text in as many ways as I could think of, and I like to think of the top line as a timeline of American history, and the last line as a poem, and it says, \"I am the man.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "17D958F5A8",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "79",
        "end": "79",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 13,
        "text": "Who's the man",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "52CCC3D835",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "80",
        "end": "80",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 11,
        "text": "You the man",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "80277E59C9",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "81",
        "end": "81",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "What a man",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "6760CA3242",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "82",
        "end": "82",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 8,
        "text": "I am man",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7B57251B59",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "83",
        "end": "83",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 9,
        "text": "I am many",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "78553FCC3D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "84",
        "end": "84",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "I am, am I",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B14DC14E25",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "85",
        "end": "85",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "I am, I am",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "B73D041E21",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "86",
        "end": "86",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "I am, Amen",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "REP"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7F1A2993C4",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "87",
        "end": "87",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 24,
        "text": "DW: Wow, so fascinating.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "8903D34D4D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "88",
        "end": "88",
        "startOffset": 11,
        "endOffset": 116,
        "text": "But what we learn from this experience is the most powerful two words in the English language is, \"I am.\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "ENG"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A6BFDD0C38",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "89",
        "end": "89",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 38,
        "text": "And we each have the capacity to love.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "4A0FB694C3",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "90",
        "end": "90",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "Thank you.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9C5301A1B6",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "91",
        "end": "91",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 10,
        "text": "(Applause)",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "NONE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D30B37C933",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "30",
        "end": "30",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 133,
        "text": "DW: While studying in art school -- it's probably true -- I had a male professor who told me that I was taking up a good man's space.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "D694962983",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "31",
        "end": "31",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 55,
        "text": "He tried to stifle my dream of becoming a photographer.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "2C711F1DB5",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "32",
        "end": "32",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 63,
        "text": "He attempted to shame me in a class full of male photographers.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9B64C6A512",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "33",
        "end": "33",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 187,
        "text": "He told me I was out of place and out of order as a woman, and he went on to say that all you could and would do was to have a baby when a good man could have had your seat in this class.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "E71F9F9531",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "34",
        "end": "34",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "I was shocked into silence into that experience.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BEB66F692B",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "35",
        "end": "35",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 101,
        "text": "But I had my camera, and I was determined to prove to him that I was worthy for a seat in that class.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "BA7B9CCEE1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "36",
        "end": "36",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 71,
        "text": "But in retrospect, I asked myself: \"Why did I need to prove it to him?\"",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "5063E27847",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "37",
        "end": "37",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 112,
        "text": "You know, I had my camera, and I knew I needed to prove to myself that I would make a difference in photography.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "203411BB55",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "38",
        "end": "38",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 70,
        "text": "I love photography, and no one is going to stop me from making images.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "06E960FBBA",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "39",
        "end": "39",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 31,
        "text": "HWT: But that's when I came in.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "9D4A43EE0D",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "40",
        "end": "40",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 48,
        "text": "DW: Yeah, that year I graduated, I got pregnant.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "957B2F59C1",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "41",
        "end": "41",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 18,
        "text": "Yep, he was right.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "7A94EE8768",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "42",
        "end": "42",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 204,
        "text": "And I had you, and I shook off that sexist language that he used against me and picked up my camera and made photographs daily, and made photographs of my pregnant belly as I prepared for graduate school.",
        "paragraphlabels": [
          "INCOMPLETE"
        ]
      },
      "id": "A9FCC5B6C0",
      "from_name": "label",
      "to_name": "text",
      "type": "paragraphlabels",
      "origin": "manual"
    },
    {
      "value": {
        "start": "43",
        "end": "43",
        "startOffset": 0,
        "endOffset": 145,
